<title>USA: Comdial Corp sees higher Q3 net, revs.</title>
<headline>Comdial Corp sees higher Q3 net, revs.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTESVILLE, Va. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comdial Corp said on Wednesday it expects its third quarter net income to be between $875,000 and $925,000, and revenue in the same period to be between $28 million and $29 million.</p>
<p>In the second quarter, the company reported net income loss of $1.6 million and net sales was $23 million.</p>
<p>The company said results for that period ending September 29 was aided by higher-than-expected sales.</p>
<p>It said it will report third quarter results the morning of October 22.</p>
</text>
